# 构建上下文裁剪:避免把本地数据、密钥、缓存打进镜像(Dockerfile 只 COPY backend 与 frontend/dist)
.git
.gitignore
.trae
.zcode
.pytest_cache
tmp
data
.env
.env.*
docker-compose.yml
README.md

# Python 缓存与本地虚拟环境
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
backend/.venv
backend/venv
# backend/data contains required versioned seed assets; keep it in images.

# 前端源码与依赖(镜像只需要 frontend/dist)
frontend/node_modules
frontend/src
frontend/public
frontend/index.html
frontend/package.json
frontend/package-lock.json
frontend/vite.config.js
